WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.000
She took the midnight train

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.260
Going anywhere

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:36.000
Just a city and a home

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.840
Born and raised right here in Houston

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.860
It's a big night

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:45.580
Going anywhere

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:47.440
New

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:06.440
I'll see you in a smoky room

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:10.480
Just for the wine that she met you

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.920
Oh, I smile, I can share the night

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:16.920
It goes on and on and on

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:17.620
Go on!

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:21.220
Strangers, weddings

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:25.040
Opened up my heart

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:27.000
And shadows

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.620
Searching through the night

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:36.440
Streetlights, people

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:40.620
Living just a fine emotion

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:46.600
High, somewhere through the night

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:04.820
Thank you.
